      "id": "claim_01e5ca66c40b47a6b7f4107c51d82783",
      "statement": "Brijio executes each browser operation as one explicit, authenticated WebSocket round trip from the MCP server to the browser extension and back, with no continuous browser mirroring; every read, action, navigation, download, fetch, and screenshot is initiated by an MCP tool or resource call and returns a structured success-or-typed-error result.",
