      "id": "claim_496b798ec2e74cd48ca2031ff59b829b",
      "statement": "tabId is threaded per-call and statelessly from MCP tool input through the relay to the extension: websocket-client places it in envelope.target.tabId, the relay forwards it unchanged, BrijioBackgroundController.extractTabId parses message.target?.tabId to a number (undefined falls back to the active tab), and the shared page-reader helpers use that numeric tabId directly for executeScript and sendMessage or query the active tab when absent.",
